{"version":1,"content":"<p>微軟正在調整 Windows 11 的網絡測速功能。在最新的 Insider Experimental 預覽版本中，用户可以直接在系統的「快速設置」界面中測試網絡速度，無需再打開默認瀏覽器並跳轉至 Bing 頁面。這項變化改善了功能的使用體驗，也讓外界再次關注微軟此前是否藉助系統工具為自家搜尋引擎導流。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1583650.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-24T06:21:21.814851+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":157,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-24T05:58:26+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T06:18:10.021966+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-24T06:18:10.021966+00:00","content_hash":"ce008adeb310fd014dccca0168569bd94442096c74baeb618f59f78bb1208b02","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}